  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Mix 2 Roma tomatoes, finely diced, 1/2 white onion, finely diced, 1 serrano chile, minced, 1/2 bunch cilantro, chopped, 1 tbsp lime juice (for the salsa) and 1/2 tsp salt (for the salsa) for the salsa. Whisk 120 ml Mexican crema, 2 tbsp mayonnaise, 1 tbsp lime juice and 1 tbsp milk until pourable.",
