  "notes": "The batter should be cold and freshly mixed: the beer's bubbles and the baking powder are what make it lacy and light. Let the oil come back to 185°C between batches.\n\nEnsenada stands also set out pickled jalapeños and carrots, guacamole and bottled hot sauce. Shrimp work the same way (tacos de camarón): fry 2 minutes.",
